# Cargo.lock IS committed. This workspace builds applications, not a library,
# so the lock file is the reproducible-build record -- and it is the only place
# that pins `mp3lame-sys 0.1.11`, the exact version whose vendored LAME the
# licence notices in THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES describe. Ignoring it would leave
# those notices citing a version nothing records.

# Internal working documents -- deliberately NOT published.
#
# These are the agent/operator handoff records. They contain no credentials,
# but they are candid cross-project engineering notes (status of sibling
# projects, local tree layout, planning-document references) written for this
# workstation rather than for a reader of the repository. They stay in the
# working tree and in the file cabinet; the public face of this project is
# README.md + THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES. Reversible: add them later if wanted.
BSM_HANDOFF.md
handoffs.md
